{"url": "https://www.12-travel.de/reiseziele/T%C3%BCrkei/", "status_code": 200, "content": "<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"de\"><head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n  <meta name=\"robots\" content=\"noindex,nofollow\">\n  <title>Cookie-Einstellungen</title>\n  <style>\n    *{box-sizing:border-box}html,body{min-height:100%}body{margin:0;background:#eef2f6 center/cover fixed no-repeat;background-image:var(--consent-bg);color:#222;font:14px/1.55 Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;padding:20px}a{color:#0159b8;cursor:pointer;text-decoration:underline}#cookie-gate{width:min(900px,100%);margin:auto;background:#0159b8;color:#fff;border-radius:8px;box-shadow:0 8px 35px rgba(0,0,0,.25);padding:24px}.title{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;font-size:22px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:16px}#domain-text{white-space: nowrap;}.title img{display:block;max-width:210px;max-height:42px}.panel{max-height:65vh;overflow:auto;background:#fff;color:#222;border-radius:5px;padding:20px}.intro p{margin:0 0 14px}.settings{display:none}.settings.open{display:block}.group{border-top:1px solid #ddd;padding:14px 0}.group-head{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px}.group h2{font-size:17px;margin:0;cursor:pointer;text-decoration:underline}.description{display:none;padding-top:10px}.group.open .description{display:block}.switch{display:flex;border:0;padding:0}.switch button{border:0;padding:6px 10px;background:#ddd;color:#333;cursor:pointer}.switch button:first-child{border-radius:4px 0 0 4px}.switch button:last-child{border-radius:0 4px 4px 0}.switch button.active{background:#0159b8;color:#fff}.switch.required button{cursor:default}.actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;justify-content:flex-end;padding-top:18px}.button{border:1px solid #fff;border-radius:4px;background:#fff;color:#0159b8;font-weight:700;padding:10px 16px;cursor:pointer}.button.secondary{background:transparent;color:#fff}.button[data-action=\"all\"]{ background: #009f3a;\n  color: #fff;border-color:#009f3a;}.links{margin-top:20px;white-space: nowrap;}.links a{color:#fff;margin-right:14px}.action-panel{display: flex;flex-direction: row-reverse;justify-content: space-between;align-items: center;}.cookie-list{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin-top:12px;font-size:12px}.cookie-list caption{text-align:left;font-weight:700;padding:8px 0}.cookie-list th,.cookie-list td{border:1px solid #ddd;padding:6px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top}.cookie-list th{background:#f2f5f8}.legal-panels{display:none;margin-top:16px;background:#fff;color:#222;border-radius:5px;max-height:52vh;overflow:auto;padding:18px}.legal-panels.open{display:block}.legal-panel{display:none}.legal-panel.active{display:block}.legal-panel h1,.legal-panel h2,.legal-panel h3,.legal-panel h4{line-height:1.25}.legal-panel a{color:#0159b8}.legal-panel-close{float:right;border:0;background:#0159b8;color:#fff;border-radius:4px;padding:6px 10px;cursor:pointer}\n    body{display:grid;place-items:center;min-height:100vh}body::before{content:\"\";position:fixed;inset:0;background:rgba(0,0,0,.75);z-index:0;pointer-events:none}#cookie-gate{position:relative;z-index:1}\n    @media(max-width:600px){body{display:block;padding:0;background-image:var(--consent-bg-mobile);background-position:top center;background-size:100% auto;background-attachment:scroll}#cookie-gate{position:fixed;left:0;right:0;bottom:0;width:100%;max-height:100vh;margin:0;overflow:auto;border-radius:0;padding:16px}.title{font-size:18px}.title img{max-width:145px;max-height:34px}.panel{max-height:70vh;padding:15px}.links{text-align:center;margin-top:40px}.button{width:100%}.action-panel{display:flex;flex-direction:column}}\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body class=\"site-12-travel tld-de\" style=\"--consent-bg: url(&quot;/static/12t/img/backgrounds/12-travel-de.png&quot;); --consent-bg-mobile: url(&quot;/static/12t/img/backgrounds/12-travel-de-mobile.png&quot;);\">\n  <main id=\"cookie-gate\" role=\"dialog\" aria-modal=\"true\" aria-labelledby=\"gate-title\">\n    <div class=\"title\" id=\"gate-title\"><span>Cookies auf <span id=\"domain-text\">12-travel.de</span></span><img id=\"domain-logo\" alt=\"12-travel.de\" src=\"/static/12t/img/12-travel-de.svg\"></div>\n    <div class=\"panel\">\n      <section class=\"intro\">\n        <p><strong>Wir verwenden Cookies, um die Leistung der Website zu verbessern, Analysen durchzuführen und Ihnen Inhalte zu zeigen, die für Ihren nächsten Traumurlaub relevant sind.</strong></p>\n        <p>Wir verwenden Cookies und personenbezogene Daten, um Inhalte und Anzeigen zu personalisieren. Weitere Informationen finden Sie in unserer Datenschutzerklärung und in den Datenschutzbestimmungen von Google.</p>\n        <p>Sie können alle Cookies akzeptieren, nur notwendige Cookies zulassen oder eine individuelle Auswahl treffen. Diese Auswahl können Sie später ändern oder widerrufen.</p>\n      </section>\n      <section class=\"settings\" id=\"settings\">\n        <div class=\"group\">\n          <div class=\"group-head\"><h2>Notwendige Cookies</h2><div class=\"switch required\"><button type=\"button\">aus</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"active\">an</button></div></div>\n          <div class=\"description\">\n            Diese Cookies sind für Suchanfragen, Vergleiche, Buchungen und grundlegende Funktionen der Website zwingend erforderlich.\n            <table class=\"cookie-list\">\n              <caption>Eigene Cookies</caption>\n              <thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Typ/Zweck</th><th>Haltbarkeit</th></tr></thead>\n              <tbody>\n                <tr><td>PHPSESSID</td><td>Sitzungscookie</td><td>Sitzungsende</td></tr>\n                <tr><td>cookieConsent</td><td>Speichert die Cookie-Auswahl</td><td>90 Tage</td></tr>\n                <tr><td>rvh</td><td>Zuletzt gesehene Hotels</td><td>7 Tage</td></tr>\n                <tr><td>hotel_sorting</td><td>Nutzerseitige Sortierung</td><td>90 Minuten</td></tr>\n                <tr><td>show_ap_map</td><td>Anzeige der Flughafenkarte</td><td>30 Tage</td></tr>\n                <tr><td>HotelsListView</td><td>Ansicht der Hotelliste auf mobilen Geräten</td><td>30 Tage</td></tr>\n                <tr><td>bl</td><td>Anzeige Bundesland im Kalender</td><td>90 Tage</td></tr>\n                <tr><td>_dc_gtm_UA-XXX</td><td>Google Tag Manager Identifier</td><td>1 Tag</td></tr>\n              </tbody>\n            </table>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"group\" data-group=\"analysis\">\n          <div class=\"group-head\"><h2>Analyse</h2><div class=\"switch\"><button type=\"button\" data-value=\"off\" class=\"active\">aus</button><button type=\"button\" data-value=\"on\">an</button></div></div>\n          <div class=\"description\">\n            Anonyme Nutzungsdaten helfen uns, die Leistung und Wirksamkeit der Website und angezeigter Inhalte zu messen.\n            <table class=\"cookie-list\">\n              <caption>Facebook Tracking</caption>\n              <thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Typ/Zweck</th><th>Haltbarkeit</th></tr></thead>\n              <tbody>\n                <tr><td>_fbp</td><td>Sammelt Daten für Facebookanzeigen</td><td>90 Tage</td></tr>\n              </tbody>\n            </table>\n            <table class=\"cookie-list\">\n              <caption>Bing Tracking</caption>\n              <thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Typ/Zweck</th><th>Haltbarkeit</th></tr></thead>\n              <tbody>\n                <tr><td>MR</td><td>Trackt Anzeigen, die der Nutzer klickt</td><td>3 Monate</td></tr>\n                <tr><td>MUID</td><td>Microsoft Nutzerkennung</td><td>2 Jahre</td></tr>\n                <tr><td>MUIDB</td><td>Microsoft Nutzerkennung</td><td>2 Jahre</td></tr>\n                <tr><td>w</td><td>Bing Tracking</td><td>1 Jahr</td></tr>\n                <tr><td>TOptOut</td><td>Opt-Out-Status</td><td>5 Jahre</td></tr>\n              </tbody>\n            </table>\n            <table class=\"cookie-list\">\n              <caption>Google Analytics</caption>\n              <thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Typ/Zweck</th><th>Haltbarkeit</th></tr></thead>\n              <tbody>\n                <tr><td>_ga</td><td>Anonyme Daten zur Nutzung der Website</td><td>2 Jahre</td></tr>\n                <tr><td>_gat</td><td>Performance-Regulierung</td><td>1 Minute</td></tr>\n                <tr><td>_gid</td><td>Eindeutige ID zur Analyse des Nutzerverhaltens</td><td>1 Tag</td></tr>\n                <tr><td>__utma</td><td>Besucher-ID, erster Besuch, aktiver Besuch, Seitenaufrufe</td><td>2 Jahre</td></tr>\n                <tr><td>__utmb</td><td>Pageviews und Aufenthaltszeit</td><td>30 Minuten</td></tr>\n                <tr><td>__utmz</td><td>Besucherquellen und Kampagnen-Tracking</td><td>6 Monate</td></tr>\n              </tbody>\n            </table>\n            <table class=\"cookie-list\">\n              <caption>Google Dienste</caption>\n              <thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Typ/Zweck</th><th>Haltbarkeit</th></tr></thead>\n              <tbody>\n                <tr><td>1P_JAR</td><td>Websitestatistiken und Conversion Rates</td><td>1 Monat</td></tr>\n                <tr><td>PAIDCONTENT</td><td>Werbe-/Content-Messung</td><td>1 Monat</td></tr>\n                <tr><td>OGP</td><td>Google Dienste</td><td>1 Monat</td></tr>\n                <tr><td>OGPC</td><td>Google Dienste</td><td>1 Woche</td></tr>\n                <tr><td>HSID</td><td>Google Sicherheits-/Nutzerkennung</td><td>2 Jahre</td></tr>\n                <tr><td>DV</td><td>Google Dienste</td><td>Sitzungsende</td></tr>\n                <tr><td>AID</td><td>Google Anzeigenkennung</td><td>1 Tag</td></tr>\n                <tr><td>CGIC</td><td>Google Dienste</td><td>6 Monate</td></tr>\n                <tr><td>CONSENT</td><td>Google Consent-Status</td><td>10 Jahre</td></tr>\n                <tr><td>NID</td><td>Google Voreinstellungen, z. B. Sprache und SafeSearch</td><td>6 Monate</td></tr>\n                <tr><td>SNID</td><td>Google Dienste</td><td>6 Monate</td></tr>\n                <tr><td>SIDCC</td><td>Google Sicherheits-/Nutzerkennung</td><td>3 Monate</td></tr>\n              </tbody>\n            </table>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"group\" data-group=\"advertising\">\n          <div class=\"group-head\"><h2>Advertising</h2><div class=\"switch\"><button type=\"button\" data-value=\"off\" class=\"active\">aus</button><button type=\"button\" data-value=\"on\">an</button></div></div>\n          <div class=\"description\">\n            Diese Cookies dienen der Messung und gegebenenfalls Personalisierung von Werbung und Inhalten.\n            <table class=\"cookie-list\">\n              <caption>Awin</caption>\n              <thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Typ/Zweck</th><th>Haltbarkeit</th></tr></thead>\n              <tbody>\n                <tr><td>awc</td><td>Speichert die Awin Click Checksum für Affiliate- und Conversion-Zuordnung</td><td>1 Jahr</td></tr>\n              </tbody>\n            </table>\n            <table class=\"cookie-list\">\n              <caption>Criteo</caption>\n              <thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Typ/Zweck</th><th>Haltbarkeit</th></tr></thead>\n              <tbody>\n                <tr><td>criteo_write_test</td><td>Criteo Test-Cookie</td><td>1 Tag</td></tr>\n                <tr><td>cto_bundle</td><td>Criteo Display Remarketing</td><td>30 Tage</td></tr>\n                <tr><td>cto_idcpy</td><td>Criteo Display Remarketing</td><td>6 Monate</td></tr>\n                <tr><td>cto_lwid</td><td>Webseitenübergreifendes Criteo Nutzerverhalten</td><td>6 Monate</td></tr>\n              </tbody>\n            </table>\n            <table class=\"cookie-list\">\n              <caption>Google Ads</caption>\n              <thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Typ/Zweck</th><th>Haltbarkeit</th></tr></thead>\n              <tbody>\n                <tr><td>_gcl_au</td><td>Conversion Tracking über Google Ads / Google Tag Manager</td><td>90 Tage</td></tr>\n              </tbody>\n            </table>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"group\" data-group=\"social\">\n          <div class=\"group-head\"><h2>Social Media Cookies</h2><div class=\"switch\"><button type=\"button\" data-value=\"off\" class=\"active\">aus</button><button type=\"button\" data-value=\"on\">an</button></div></div>\n          <div class=\"description\">\n            Diese Cookies ermöglichen die Interaktion mit Inhalten und Funktionen externer sozialer Netzwerke.\n            <table class=\"cookie-list\">\n              <caption>Facebook Like</caption>\n              <thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Typ/Zweck</th><th>Haltbarkeit</th></tr></thead>\n              <tbody>\n                <tr><td>datr</td><td>Facebook Browser ID</td><td>2 Jahre</td></tr>\n                <tr><td>fr</td><td>Encrypted Facebook ID and Browser ID</td><td>90 Tage</td></tr>\n                <tr><td>sb</td><td>Facebook Browser-/Sicherheitskennung</td><td>2 Jahre</td></tr>\n                <tr><td>wd</td><td>Fenstergröße</td><td>7 Tage</td></tr>\n                <tr><td>xs</td><td>Session number and secret</td><td>90 Tage</td></tr>\n              </tbody>\n            </table>\n            <table class=\"cookie-list\">\n              <caption>YouTube</caption>\n              <thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Typ/Zweck</th><th>Haltbarkeit</th></tr></thead>\n              <tbody>\n                <tr><td>GPS</td><td>YouTube Standort-/Nutzungsdaten</td><td>1 Tag</td></tr>\n                <tr><td>PREF</td><td>Voreinstellungen, z. B. Sprache und Suchergebnisse</td><td>1 Tag</td></tr>\n                <tr><td>VISITOR_INFO1_LIVE</td><td>Misst Bandbreite für Playeransicht</td><td>180 Tage</td></tr>\n                <tr><td>use_hitbox</td><td>Erhöht Views-Zähler</td><td>Sitzungsende</td></tr>\n                <tr><td>YSC</td><td>Cookie für eingebettete YouTube-Videos</td><td>Sitzungsende</td></tr>\n              </tbody>\n            </table>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"group\" data-group=\"tools\">\n          <div class=\"group-head\"><h2>Erweiterte Funktionen</h2><div class=\"switch\"><button type=\"button\" data-value=\"off\" class=\"active\">aus</button><button type=\"button\" data-value=\"on\">an</button></div></div>\n          <div class=\"description\">\n            Diese Cookies ermöglichen zusätzliche Funktionen wie Karten und andere externe Dienste.\n            <table class=\"cookie-list\">\n              <caption>Google Maps</caption>\n              <thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Typ/Zweck</th><th>Haltbarkeit</th></tr></thead>\n              <tbody>\n                <tr><td>NID</td><td>Google Voreinstellungen, z. B. Sprache und SafeSearch</td><td>6 Monate</td></tr>\n                <tr><td>CONSENT</td><td>Google Consent-Status</td><td>10 Jahre</td></tr>\n              </tbody>\n            </table>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"action-panel\">\n      <div class=\"actions\">\n        <button class=\"button secondary\" type=\"button\" id=\"settings-toggle\">Cookie-Einstellungen</button>\n        <button class=\"button secondary\" type=\"button\" data-action=\"necessary\">Nur notwendige</button>\n        <button class=\"button\" type=\"button\" data-action=\"selection\" hidden=\"\">Auswahl zustimmen</button>\n        <button class=\"button\" type=\"button\" data-action=\"all\">Alle akzeptieren</button>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"links\"><a href=\"#datenschutz\" data-src=\"/static/consent/datenschutz.html#p3\" data-target=\"datenschutz\">Datenschutz</a><a href=\"#impressum\" data-src=\"/static/consent/impressum.html\" data-target=\"impressum\">Impressum</a><a href=\"#agb\" data-src=\"/static/consent/agb.html\" data-target=\"agb\">AGB</a></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"legal-panels\" id=\"legal-panels\">\n      <section class=\"legal-panel\" id=\"datenschutz\" tabindex=\"-1\"></section>\n      <section class=\"legal-panel\" id=\"impressum\" tabindex=\"-1\"></section>\n      <section class=\"legal-panel\" id=\"agb\" tabindex=\"-1\"></section>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n  <script src=\"/static/consent/legal-vars.js\"></script>\n  <script>\n    (function(){\n      var gate=document.getElementById('cookie-gate');\n      var settings=document.getElementById('settings');\n      var selection=gate.querySelector('[data-action=\"selection\"]');\n      var legalVars=window.consentLegalVars.get();\n      var tld='-'+legalVars.tld;\n      var domain=legalVars.siteName;\n      var assetRoot=domain==='online-reisesuche'?'/static/olrs':'/static/12t';\n      document.body.style.setProperty('--consent-bg','url(\"'+assetRoot+'/img/backgrounds/'+domain+tld+'.png\")');\n      document.body.style.setProperty('--consent-bg-mobile','url(\"'+assetRoot+'/img/backgrounds/'+domain+tld+'-mobile.png\")');\n      document.body.classList.add('site-'+domain,'tld-'+tld.slice(1));\n      var logo=document.getElementById('domain-logo');\n      if(domain==='online-reisesuche')logo.src=assetRoot+'/img/'+domain+tld+'.png';\n      else logo.src=assetRoot+'/img/'+domain+tld+'.svg';\n      logo.alt=domain+tld.replace('-', '.');\n      document.getElementById('domain-text').textContent=logo.alt;\n      document.getElementById('settings-toggle').addEventListener('click',function(){settings.classList.toggle('open');selection.hidden=!settings.classList.contains('open')});\n      gate.querySelectorAll('.group h2').forEach(function(title){title.addEventListener('click',function(){title.closest('.group').classList.toggle('open')})});\n      gate.querySelectorAll('.switch:not(.required) button').forEach(function(button){button.addEventListener('click',function(){button.parentNode.querySelectorAll('button').forEach(function(item){item.classList.remove('active')});button.classList.add('active')})});\n      var legalPanels=document.getElementById('legal-panels');\n      function legalUrlWithoutHash(url){return url.split('#')[0]}\n      function legalHash(url){return url.indexOf('#')>-1?'#'+url.split('#').slice(1).join('#'):''}\n      function legalContent(html){\n        var doc=new DOMParser().parseFromString(html,'text/html');\n        var content=doc.querySelector('.legal-text')||doc.body;\n        return content?content.innerHTML:html;\n      }\n      function showLegalPanel(link){\n        var target=document.getElementById(link.dataset.target);\n        var src=link.dataset.src;\n        var hash=legalHash(src);\n        if(!target||!src)return;\n        legalPanels.classList.add('open');\n        legalPanels.querySelectorAll('.legal-panel').forEach(function(panel){panel.classList.remove('active')});\n        target.classList.add('active');\n        if(target.dataset.loaded==='1'){\n          target.focus();\n          scrollLegalPanel(target,hash);\n          return;\n        }\n        target.innerHTML='<p>Inhalt wird geladen...</p>';\n        fetch(legalUrlWithoutHash(src),{credentials:'same-origin'}).then(function(response){\n          if(!response.ok)throw new Error('load failed');\n          return response.text();\n        }).then(function(html){\n          target.innerHTML='<button class=\"legal-panel-close\" type=\"button\">schließen</button>'+legalContent(html);\n          window.consentLegalVars.apply(target);\n          target.dataset.loaded='1';\n          target.focus();\n          scrollLegalPanel(target,hash);\n        }).catch(function(){\n          target.innerHTML='<p>Der Inhalt konnte nicht geladen werden.</p>';\n        });\n      }\n      function scrollLegalPanel(panel,hash){\n        legalPanels.scrollTop=0;\n        if(hash&&panel.querySelector(hash)){\n          legalPanels.scrollTop=panel.querySelector(hash).offsetTop-panel.offsetTop;\n        }\n      }\n      gate.querySelectorAll('.links a[data-src]').forEach(function(link){\n        link.addEventListener('click',function(event){\n          event.preventDefault();\n          showLegalPanel(link);\n        });\n      });\n      legalPanels.addEventListener('click',function(event){\n        if(event.target.classList.contains('legal-panel-close')){\n          legalPanels.classList.remove('open');\n          legalPanels.querySelectorAll('.legal-panel').forEach(function(panel){panel.classList.remove('active')});\n          return;\n        }\n        if(event.target.tagName&&event.target.tagName.toLowerCase()==='a'){\n          var href=event.target.getAttribute('href')||'';\n          var activePanel=legalPanels.querySelector('.legal-panel.active');\n          if(href.indexOf('#')===0&&activePanel&&activePanel.querySelector(href)){\n            event.preventDefault();\n            scrollLegalPanel(activePanel,href);\n            return;\n          }\n          if(href.indexOf('/static/consent/')===0){\n            var path=legalUrlWithoutHash(href);\n            var targetName=path.split('/').pop().replace('.html','');\n            if(document.getElementById(targetName)){\n              event.preventDefault();\n              showLegalPanel({dataset:{target:targetName,src:href}});\n            }\n          }\n        }\n      });\n      function consentCookieDomain(){\n        var hostArr=window.location.host.split('.');\n        if(hostArr.length===3)hostArr.shift();\n        return hostArr.length===2?'; domain=.'+hostArr.join('.'):'';\n      }\n      function writeConsentCookie(value,days){\n        var secure=location.protocol==='https:'?'; Secure':'';\n        var domain=consentCookieDomain();\n        var expires='expires='+new Date(Date.now()+days*864e5).toUTCString();\n        document.cookie='cookieConsent=; expires=Thu, 01 Jan 1970 00:00:00 UTC; path=/; SameSite=Lax'+secure;\n        if(domain)document.cookie='cookieConsent=; expires=Thu, 01 Jan 1970 00:00:00 UTC; path=/; SameSite=Lax'+secure+domain;\n        document.cookie='cookieConsent='+encodeURIComponent(value)+'; '+expires+'; path=/; SameSite=Lax'+secure+domain;\n      }\n      function save(value,label){\n        var days=value?2:90;\n        writeConsentCookie(value,days);\n        var body=new URLSearchParams({data:value,button:label,action:'log_consent',ln:'0'});\n        fetch('/application/controller/ajax.router.php?route=cookie_consent',{method:'POST',credentials:'same-origin',headers:{'Content-Type':'application/x-www-form-urlencoded;charset=UTF-8','X-Requested-With':'XMLHttpRequest'},body:body.toString()}).then(reload,reload);\n      }\n      function reload(){location.reload()}\n      gate.querySelector('[data-action=\"necessary\"]').addEventListener('click',function(){save('analysis,advertising,social,tools','Nur notwendige')});\n      gate.querySelector('[data-action=\"all\"]').addEventListener('click',function(){save('','Alle akzeptieren')});\n      selection.addEventListener('click',function(){var blocked=[];gate.querySelectorAll('.group[data-group]').forEach(function(group){if(group.querySelector('[data-value=\"off\"]').classList.contains('active'))blocked.push(group.dataset.group)});save(blocked.join(','),'Auswahl zustimmen')});\n    }());\n  </script>\n\n\n</body></html>", "is_spa": false, "extracted_text": "Cookies auf 12-travel.de\nWir verwenden Cookies, um die Leistung der Website zu verbessern, Analysen durchzuführen und Ihnen Inhalte zu zeigen, die für Ihren nächsten Traumurlaub relevant sind.\nWir verwenden Cookies und personenbezogene Daten, um Inhalte und Anzeigen zu personalisieren. Weitere Informationen finden Sie in unserer Datenschutzerklärung und in den Datenschutzbestimmungen von Google.\nSie können alle Cookies akzeptieren, nur notwendige Cookies zulassen oder eine individuelle Auswahl treffen. Diese Auswahl können Sie später ändern oder widerrufen.\nNotwendige Cookies\n            Diese Cookies sind für Suchanfragen, Vergleiche, Buchungen und grundlegende Funktionen der Website zwingend erforderlich.\n            \n              Eigene Cookies \n              Name Typ/Zweck Haltbarkeit PHPSESSID Sitzungscookie Sitzungsende coo